{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is a fun and challenging side scrolling adventure game, with vibrant cartoon style graphics providing a visually pleasing experience. Players control a nimble and cute little elf, using the AD key to move left and right, and the W key to jump, in a carefully designed game navigation. This road is full of surprises. However, the road is also filled with obstacles such as turbulent rivers and sharp teeth, which require players to cleverly avoid them. The sound design of the game is excellent, with cool sound effects accompanying every action, greatly enhancing the immersive experience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1540010?t=1740373635","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1540010?t=1740373635","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1540010/dc4c8447390c5be51a6e1fa988b538a235cb1ce0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740373635","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1540010/dc4c8447390c5be51a6e1fa988b538a235cb1ce0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740373635","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is a fun and challenging side scrolling adventure game, with vibrant cartoon style graphics providing a visually pleasing experience. Players control a nimble and cute little elf, using the AD key to move left and right, and the W key to jump, in a carefully designed game navigation. This road is full of surprises. However, the road is also filled with obstacles such as turbulent rivers and sharp teeth, which require players to cleverly avoid them. The sound design of the game is excellent, with cool sound effects accompanying every action, greatly enhancing the immersive experience.</p>","devel